Z||000001||Oreif||06-18-2001||08:28 PM||||Last I heard they disconnected their phone.<BR>I hounded them for a week where I Emailed them at the Ebay address and the website address every day for a week before they finally replied. When the items finally  came they were packaged very poorly, and the quality of the parts was very poor also. I was told no less than 4 times that the items would ship on XX day and I would be supplied a tracking number. The final time they did supply a tracking number. But I had to basically harass them constantly. The items were side scoops that I bid on for a friend. He still bought them but they do need an awful lot of work before they can be painted. We haven't even addressed what needs to be done to make them fit yet. I would not recommend them or their products to anyone.<P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">     <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 06-18-2001).]||||reg||13
